{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29652","headline":"魏侯第东北楼堂郢叔言别聊用书所见成篇 · 李商隐","name":"魏侯第东北楼堂郢叔言别聊用书所见成篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暗楼连夜阁，不拟爲黄昏。\n未必断别泪，何曾妨梦魂。\n疑穿花逶迤，渐近火温黁。\n海底翻无水，仙家却有邨。\n锁香金屈[戌]，殢酒玉崑仑。\n羽白风交扇，冰清月映盆。\n旧欢尘自积，新岁电犹奔。\n霞绮空留段，云峰不带根。\n念君千里舸，江草漏灯痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29652.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29652","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}